-- Every CREATE TABLE/INDEX already used IF NOT EXISTS; every CREATE POLICY
-- and CREATE TRIGGER below has been given a matching DROP ... IF EXISTS
-- immediately before it (auto-generated from the individual migration
-- files in this repo), so running this against a database that already
-- has some or all of these objects will NOT raise "already exists"
-- errors — it will just redefine them to match this file and move on.
